  "chapters": [
    {
      "chapterId": "cap-loop-invariant",
      "slug": "loop-invariant",
      "title": "Loop Invariant",
      "order": 1,
      "summary": "Proof of correctness through loop invariants, applied to sorting algorithms.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-loop-invariant-introduccion",
          "slug": "loop-invariant-introduccion",
          "title": "2. Loop Invariant",
          "order": 1,
          "kind": "overview",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 6,
          "learningObjectives": [
            {
              "objectiveId": "comprender-loop-invariant",
              "text": "Understand that the loop invariant replaces validation for particular cases."
            },
            {
              "objectiveId": "identificar-tres-momentos",
              "text": "Identify initialization, maintenance and termination as the three mandatory moments."
            }
          ],
          "prerequisites": {
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "mod-complejidad-temporal-espacial",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "blk-loop-invariant-definicion",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The loop invariant is the mechanism we use to prove that an algorithm is correct, that is, that it does what it says it does. It replaces the habit of testing with cases, since cases never demonstrate general correctness."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-loop-invariant-propiedad-intro",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The invariant is a logical property that:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-loop-invariant-propiedades",
              "type": "list",
              "style": "unordered",
              "items": [
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "It captures the reason for the algorithm (its semantics)."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "It is associated with the main loop of the algorithm."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "It must be demonstrated in exactly 3 moments."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-loop-invariant-tres-momentos-heading",
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The 3 moments of Loop Invariant"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-loop-invariant-tres-momentos",
              "type": "list",
              "style": "ordered",
              "items": [
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong",
                      "text": "INITIALIZATION: "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The property is true before the first iteration of the loop."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong",
                      "text": "MAINTENANCE: "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "If the property is true before one iteration, it remains true before the next iteration."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "strong",
                      "text": "TERMINATION: "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When the loop ends, the property combined with the termination condition proves that the algorithm is working correctly."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-secuencia-conjunto",
          "slug": "secuencia-conjunto",
          "title": "2.1 Notions of Sequence and Set",
          "order": 2,
          "kind": "theory",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 5,
          "learningObjectives": [
            {
              "objectiveId": "diferenciar-secuencia-conjunto",
              "text": "Differentiate sequence and set to avoid poorly formulated invariants."
            }
          ],
          "prerequisites": {
            "modules": [],
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "sec-loop-invariant-introduccion",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ]
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "blk-secuencia-conjunto-intro",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "To formulate invariants correctly, it is crucial to distinguish:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-definicion-secuencia",
              "type": "definition",
              "title": "Sequence",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-definicion-secuencia-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The order matters."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "S_1 = \\langle 3, 7, 1, 5, 4 \\rangle"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "is different from"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "S_2 = \\langle 7, 3, 5, 4, 1 \\rangle"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "even if they have the same elements."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-definicion-conjunto",
              "type": "definition",
              "title": "Set",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-definicion-conjunto-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The order doesn't matter."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "A = \\{3, 7, 1, 5, 4\\}"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "is the same as"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "B = \\{7, 1, 5, 3, 4\\}"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-secuencia-conjunto-cierre",
              "type": "note",
              "variant": "info",
              "title": "Rule for invariants",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-secuencia-conjunto-cierre-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In invariants you always work with sequences when the order of the elements matters (as in ordering)."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-insertion-sort-invariante",
          "slug": "insertion-sort-invariante",
          "title": "2.2 Example: Insertion Algorithm",
          "order": 3,
          "kind": "example",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 10,
          "learningObjectives": [
            {
              "objectiveId": "entender-insertion-sort",
              "text": "Understand how Insertion Sort works under the incremental paradigm."
            },
            {
              "objectiveId": "formular-invariante-for-insertion",
              "text": "Formulate the invariant of the Insertion Sort for loop."
            },
            {
              "objectiveId": "demostrar-invariante-insertion",
              "text": "Demonstrate the invariant of Insertion Sort in initialization, maintenance and termination."
            }
          ],
          "prerequisites": {
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "mod-complejidad-temporal-espacial",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ],
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "sec-secuencia-conjunto",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ]
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-intro",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The insertion sort algorithm works under the incremental paradigm: it maintains an ordered subarray that grows with each iteration."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-code",
              "type": "algorithm",
              "language": "pseudocode",
              "title": "InsertionSort",
              "code": "InsertionSort (I/O int A[n]) {\n for i <- 2 to n do\n  x <- A[i]\n  j <- i - 1\n  while (j >= 1) and (x < A[j]) do\n   A[j+1] <- A[j]\n   j <- j - 1\n  endwhile\n  A[j+1] <- x\n endfor\n}"
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-como-funciona",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "How does it work? Start in position 2 ("
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "i=2"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "). For each position"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "i"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ", extract the element"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "A[i]"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "and inserts it in the correct position within the already sorted subarray"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "A[1..i-1]"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-invariante",
              "type": "note",
              "variant": "info",
              "title": "for loop invariant",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-insertion-sort-invariante-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The elements in the positions"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "A[1..i-1]"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "They are the same elements that were in"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "A[1..i-1]"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "at the beginning, but organized in non-decreasing order."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-demostracion-heading",
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Proof of the three moments"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-demostracion-tabla",
              "type": "table",
              "title": "Proof of the Insertion Sort invariant",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "key": "momento",
                  "label": "Moment"
                },
                {
                  "key": "i",
                  "label": "i"
                },
                {
                  "key": "estado",
                  "label": "Fixed state"
                },
                {
                  "key": "cumple",
                  "label": "Is it fulfilled?"
                }
              ],
              "rows": [
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Initialization"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "i = 2"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "A[1..1]"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "It has only one element. By definition, an array of one element is ordered."
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Yes"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Maintenance"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "i = k"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Before iteration"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "k"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": ","
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "A[1..k-1]"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "It is sorted. The while inserts"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "A[k]"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "in its correct place, leaving"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "A[1..k]"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "ordered."
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Yes"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Termination"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "i = n+1"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "When the for ends ("
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "i=n+1"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "), the property says that"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "A[1..n]"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "It is sorted. The entire array is sorted."
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Demonstrated correctness"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-sort-nota-j",
              "type": "note",
              "variant": "warning",
              "title": "Note",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-insertion-sort-nota-j-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In the formulation of the invariant we never talk about"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "j"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "(internal loop variable). The for invariant only talks about"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "i"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". Each loop has its own invariant."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sectionId": "sec-insertion-sort-eficiencia",
          "slug": "insertion-sort-eficiencia",
          "title": "2.3 Efficiency Analysis — Insertion Sort",
          "order": 4,
          "kind": "example",
          "trackProgress": true,
          "estimatedMinutes": 8,
          "learningObjectives": [
            {
              "objectiveId": "analizar-mejor-caso-insertion",
              "text": "Analyze the best case of Insertion Sort when the array is already sorted."
            },
            {
              "objectiveId": "analizar-peor-caso-insertion",
              "text": "Analyze the worst case of Insertion Sort when the array is in reverse order."
            }
          ],
          "prerequisites": {
            "modules": [
              {
                "id": "mod-complejidad-temporal-espacial",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ],
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "sec-insertion-sort-invariante",
                "kind": "required"
              }
            ]
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-mejor-heading",
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Best Case (fix already ordered)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-mejor-explicacion",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The while is never executed because the condition"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "x < A[j]"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "is always false (the element to be inserted is already in place)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-mejor-tabla",
              "type": "table",
              "title": "Best Case of Insertion Sort",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "key": "linea",
                  "label": "Line"
                },
                {
                  "key": "costo",
                  "label": "Cost"
                }
              ],
              "rows": [
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "for i <- 2 to n"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "n"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "x <- A[i]"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "n-1"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "j <- i-1"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "n-1"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "while (condition)"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "n-1"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "A[j+1] <- x"
                      }
                    ],
                    [
                      {
                        "type": "inlineMath",
                        "latex": "n-1"
                      }
                    ]
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-mejor-resultado",
              "type": "note",
              "variant": "success",
              "title": "Best case result",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-mejor-resultado-texto",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "T_{best}(n) = A n — B"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "-> linear"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "inlineMath",
                      "latex": "O(n)"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-peor-heading",
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Worst Case (array in reverse order)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-peor-explicacion",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The while is executed the maximum number of times. For the iteration"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "i"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ", the while is executed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "inlineMath",
                  "latex": "i-1"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "times (you have to move the element to position 1)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-peor-sumatoria",
              "type": "equationBlock",
              "latex": "\\sum_{i=2}^{n}(i-1) = 1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + (n-1) = \\frac{n(n-1)}{2}"
            },
            {
              "id": "blk-insertion-eficiencia-peor-tabla",
              "type": "table",
              "title": "Worst Case of Insertion Sort",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "key": "linea",
                  "label": "Line"
                },
                {
                  "key": "costo",
                  "label": "Cost"
                }
              ],
              "rows": [
                {
                  "cells": [
                    [
                      {
